OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after being hit by
OL,4,Aambulance
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after being struck by an
OL,7,Fambulance transporting a patient near
OL,8,FSunderland, Northumbria Police said.
OL,10,FThe force said it happened on the A19,
OL,11,Fbetween the junctions for the A1018 and
OL,12,FA690, shortly after 02:00 GMT.
OL,14,FThe ambulance was travelling on the
OL,15,Fnorthbound carriageway and did not have
OL,16,Fits blue lights on when it hit the man,
OL,17,Fwho was in his 30s and died at the
OL,18,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
