OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after being hit by
OL,4,Aambulance
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeither the patient nor their partner
OL,7,Fwho were travelling in the ambulance
OL,8,Fwere injured in the collision, while
OL,9,Fthe vehicle's driver - a man in his 40s
OL,10,F- was also not hurt and remained at the
OL,11,Fscene to assist police with their
OL,12,Finquiries.
